@meeting train.m17.halloran-emeka
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M17 the lift roof (Thursdays 15:30-16:30 from Day 18): Halloran looks after the lift. At the top
// deck, before the climb. His words on the ride are his kind work, flags roof.<step>. Seat E3. Head writer W2.
title: The lift roof
from: Emeka Halloran
gist: Emeka took you onto the lift roof: grease the guide rails at each deck on the way down the spine.
== lines
halloran-emeka: Thursday! Lift day. My favourite hour of the week.   [gesture]
halloran-emeka > you: We ride on the roof. Slowly. At each deck, grease the guides.
halloran-emeka: Harness on. Hold the rail. Never lean out. Lovely view, though.
? choice
* We ride on top?   rel:halloran-emeka+2 flavour:listen
  halloran-emeka: Best seat on the ship. Don't tell the Captain I said so.   [laugh]
* Harness on.   rel:halloran-emeka+1 flavour:practical
  halloran-emeka: Click. Hear that? Good. Up you get.
